<title>JAPAN: Fuji TV shares ask-only.</title>
<headline>Fuji TV shares ask-only.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Fuji Television Network Inc were ask-only on Tokyo Stock Exchange in early Friday morning trade as sell orders exceeded buys by 1,170 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0051 GMT, the shares were down 18,000 at 712,000 yen after having been ask only after the opening.  </p>
<p>The nationwide broadcaster's shares had been attracting buying after they were listed on the TSE's first section on August 8.</p>
<p>The company is a unit of Nippon Broadcasting System Inc, which listed its shares on the TSE's second section on December 1996.</p>
